,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":2435413250,"text":"キャンディスも来るさ。ただ…もうしばらくは無理だ。","nextNodeIds":[715350206]},{"nodeId":715350206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":3292551986,"text":"あたしが一緒に璃月に行こうと誘ったんだが、最初は断られたんだ。村を守らなきゃって言われて…","nextNodeIds":[715350207]},{"nodeId":715350207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":2349744458,"text":"一年間頑張ったんだから気分転換しよう、あたしもちょうど璃月に向かうキャラバンを護衛するから、一緒に璃月の海灯祭に参加しよう——","nextNodeIds":[715350208]},{"nodeId":715350208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":955436818,"text":"村のことが気がかりなら、旅団の仲間たちに村を守ってもらうから、とまで言ったんだけどさ。","nextNodeIds":[715350209]},{"nodeId":715350209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":1384722634,"text":"それでもダメって言うんだ。最終的に、村のやつらにも長いこと説得されて、やっと休みを取ってくれたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[715350210]},{"nodeId":715350210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":103900666,"text":"ただ、まだやるべきことがあるから、全部済ませてから、ここに来ることになってる。","nextNodeIds":[715350211]},{"nodeId":715350211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":3239600738,"text":"ま、仕方ないよな。キャラバンは待ってくれないし…だから先に来て、キャンディスを待ってるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[715350212]},{"nodeId":715350212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":773434538,"text":"何かプレゼントを買おうと思ってたんだが、いいものがありすぎて、迷いに迷っちまったよ。","nextNodeIds":[715350213]},{"nodeId":715350213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":1436460026,"text":"結局、ネックレスを選んだんだけどな。璃月の人は海灯祭で贈り物をする時に「祝灯状」っていう特別な手紙を添えるって聞いたから、あたしも自分用に一枚作ってみようと思ってさ。","nextNodeIds":[715350214]},{"nodeId":715350214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":205401154,"text":"でも…さっきも言った通り、どう頑張っても納得行くのが作れないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[715350215]},{"nodeId":715350215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30681,"speakerName":"ディシア","textMapHash":1634600946,"text":"ちょうどいいところに来てくれたぜ。あんたなら色々知ってるだろ。アドバイスしてくれよ。","nextNodeIds":[715350216]},{"nodeId":715350216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":752936186,"text":"いいよ、ちょっと見せて…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7153502,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["30681"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7153503,"order":3,"stepDescription":"ディシアと一緒に祝灯状を完成させる","stepDescTextMapHash":4034823828,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2036,71535],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_ACTIVITY_TRIGGER_UPDATE","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["30681"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7153503],"talks":[{"talkId":7153503,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",